          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutaikirizanga mutemo kusasula kintu kyonakyona, olw'okununula obulamu bwe nga bamusaliire ogw'okufa. Aye mumwitenga bwite. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Era oyo eyalumukira mu kibuga eky'okulumukiramu, mutamwikirizanga kusasula kintu kyonakyona ng'ayenda okwirayo ku butaka bwe, ng'ate Omukulu wa Bakabona akaali kufa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kale ni mutayonoonanga nsi ye mubaamu, kuba obutemo bwonoona ensi. Era ezira ky'oghanga kukola okufunisa ensi ekisonigho olw'obutemo obwo obugikoleirwamu, okutoolaku okwita oyo eyatemula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 35:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mutayonoonanga nsi ye mubaamu, ensi nze Musengwa Katonda mwemba kuba nze Musengwa Katonda mba mu bantu bange Abaisiraeli.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.35.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.35.34"
            ]
          }
        }
